#: ../../source/docs/setting-up-sitl-using-vagrant.rst:209
#: be1863b693224976a3edbedba4c44b5a
msgid ""
"The simulator is built from the source tree shared between the host and "
"virtual machines, and any changes will trigger a rebuild next time you start"
" the simulator. To update the simulator you simply need to modify the source"
" tree (or pull a new version from Github)."
msgstr ""
"仿真器基于主机和虚拟机共享的源代码树构建，任何更改都将在下次启动仿真器时触发重新构建。要更新仿真器，只需修改源代码树（或从 Github "
"拉取新版本）即可。"

